## 5. Khuyen nghi khi chuyen sang Java Swing

### 5.1 Tuong duong component

| C# WinForms | Java Swing tuong duong |
|---|---|
| `UserControl` | `JPanel` (dung lam panel noi dung) |
| [Form](file:///d:/WorkSpace/CSharp/LibraryManagementSystem/Views/UserControls/QLMuonTraSach/MuonTraSach/FormTraSach.cs#18-449) (dialog) | `JDialog` (modal=true) |
| `DataGridView` | `JTable` + `DefaultTableModel` |
| `DataGridViewComboBoxColumn` | `TableCellEditor` dung `JComboBox` |
| `DataGridViewCheckBoxColumn` | `TableCellEditor` / `TableCellRenderer` dung `JCheckBox` |
| `DataGridViewButtonColumn` | `TableCellRenderer` + `TableCellEditor` dung `JButton` |
| [ComboBox](file:///d:/WorkSpace/CSharp/LibraryManagementSystem/Views/UserControls/QLMuonTraSach/MuonTraSach/FormTraSach.cs#237-248) | `JComboBox<T>` |
| `TextBox` (ReadOnly) | `JTextField` (setEditable(false)) |
| `DateTimePicker` | `JSpinner` voi `SpinnerDateModel` hoac thu vien `JDatePicker` |
| `MessageBox.Show()` | `JOptionPane.showMessageDialog()` / `showConfirmDialog()` |
| `ShowDialog()` | `new JDialog(parent, true).setVisible(true)` |
| `DialogResult.OK` | Custom field hoac `JDialog.dispose()` + poll ket qua |

### 5.2 Xu ly JTable phuc tap (FormTraSach)

JTable trong Java khong co column type built-in nhu WinForms. Can custom:

```java
// Cot ComboBox "TinhTrangTra"
TableColumn col = table.getColumnModel().getColumn(INDEX_TINH_TRANG_TRA);
col.setCellEditor(new DefaultCellEditor(new JComboBox<>(new String[]{"Tot", "Hong", "Mat"})));

// Cot ComboBox "MucPhat" - chi enable khi Hong/Mat
// Ghi de isCellEditable() trong TableModel:
@Override
public boolean isCellEditable(int row, int col) {
    if (col == INDEX_MUC_PHAT) {
        String tinhTrang = (String) getValueAt(row, INDEX_TINH_TRANG_TRA);
        return !"Tot".equals(tinhTrang);
    }
    return col == INDEX_TINH_TRANG_TRA || col == INDEX_CHON;
}
```

### 5.3 Lazy recalculate khi thay doi TinhTrangTra

Trong WinForms dung su kien [CellValueChanged](file:///d:/WorkSpace/CSharp/LibraryManagementSystem/Views/UserControls/QLMuonTraSach/MuonTraSach/FormTraSach.cs#174-216). Trong Java Swing:

```java
// Trong TableModel, ghi de setValueAt()
@Override
public void setValueAt(Object value, int row, int col) {
    super.setValueAt(value, row, col);
    if (col == INDEX_TINH_TRANG_TRA) {
        // Reset MucPhat neu chon lai "Tot"
        if ("Tot".equals(value)) {
            setValueAt("", row, INDEX_MUC_PHAT);
        }
        recalculateFine(row);
        fireTableRowsUpdated(row, row);
    }
    if (col == INDEX_MUC_PHAT) {
        recalculateFine(row);
        fireTableRowsUpdated(row, row);
    }
}
```

### 5.4 Button trong JTable (DisablePayButton)

Khi TrangThai != ChuaThu, can disable nut hoac an nut:

```java
// Renderer tra ve JButton chi khi "Chua thu"
class PayButtonRenderer implements TableCellRenderer {
    private JButton btn = new JButton("Thanh toan");
    private JLabel empty = new JLabel("");
    
    @Override
    public Component getTableCellRendererComponent(...) {
        String status = (String) table.getValueAt(row, COL_TRANG_THAI);
        return "Chua thu".equals(status) ? btn : empty;
    }
}
// Tuong tu voi Editor de bat su kien click
```

### 5.5 Search real-time thanh vien (FormThemPhieuMuonTra)

WinForms dung [TextChanged](file:///d:/WorkSpace/CSharp/LibraryManagementSystem/Views/UserControls/QLMuonTraSach/MuonTraSach/FormThemPhieuMuonTra.cs#130-186). Trong Java Swing:

```java
textFieldTimThanhVien.getDocument().addDocumentListener(new DocumentListener() {
    @Override
    public void insertUpdate(DocumentEvent e) { doSearch(); }
    @Override
    public void removeUpdate(DocumentEvent e) { doSearch(); }
    @Override
    public void changedUpdate(DocumentEvent e) {}
    
    private void doSearch() {
        String keyword = textFieldTimThanhVien.getText().trim();
        if (keyword.length() < 2) {
            comboBoxThanhVien.removeAllItems();
            return;
        }
        // Goi service -> populate comboBox
        List<TheThanhVien> results = theThanhVienService.timKiem(keyword);
        comboBoxThanhVien.removeAllItems();
        results.forEach(ttv -> comboBoxThanhVien.addItem(ttv));
    }
});
```

### 5.6 Quan ly DbContext / Connection

C# dung `using (var context = new LibraryDbContext())` - tao moi moi lan. Java nen:
- Dung **Singleton** cho `EntityManagerFactory` (JPA) hoac `DataSource` (JDBC)
- Tao `EntityManager` / `Connection` moi moi thao tac, dong ngay sau khi dung
- Hoac dung **Service layer** nhan `EntityManager` / `Connection` tu ngoai vao (Dependency Injection)

### 5.7 Phan trang

Hien tai C# dung page/pageSize + count query. Trong Java Swing co the:
- Giu nguyen chien luoc nay (query dem + query data phan trang)
- Quan ly bien `currentPage`, `totalPages`, `pageSize` trong Panel
- Dung `JLabel` hien "Trang X/Y", `JButton` Truoc/Sau

### 5.8 CurrentUserContext

C# dung static class `CurrentUserContext.CurrentUser`. Trong Java:
- Dung **Singleton**: `UserSession.getInstance().getCurrentUser()`
- Hoac truyen `idNhanVien` xuong form con qua constructor

---

## 6. Cac diem can chu y khi convert

1. **PhieuPhat la lazy-created**: Khong phai luc nao tra sach cung tao PhieuPhat. Chi tao khi co khoản phat (tre han hoac sach hu/mat). Phan logic nay nam trong [TraSachBulk](file:///d:/WorkSpace/CSharp/LibraryManagementSystem/LMS.Services/Services/PhieuMuonService.cs#177-283), can giu nguyen.

2. **TraSachBulk co the xu ly nhieu sach cung luc**: 1 PhieuPhat cho ca phieu muon (khong phai 1 PhieuPhat/sach). Can dam bao tong tien duoc tinh dung (cong don).

3. **Trong FormTraSach, chi hien thi chi tiet ChuaTra**: Loc `TinhTrangTra == ChuaTra` - chi tiet da tra truoc do khong hien lai.

4. **Muc phat PerDay**: He thong chi co 1 muc PerDay active. Neu khong co -> khong tinh phat tre. Can dam bao seed data hop le.

5. **DisablePayButton = thay the cell, khong an cot**: Chieu nay giu cot "ThanhToan" nhung o nao khong can phai thanh toan thi render empty. Trong Java, can custom bo Renderer + Editor theo cach tuong tu.

6. **Khong co man hinh "TRA PHAT" rieng biet**: Chuc nang tra phat (ThanhToanPhieuPhat) duoc thuc hien thang tu danh sach phieu phat (UcPhat), khong co form rieng.
